supra- (or its Cyrillic spelling)" into the residual stream. It is strongest on a
whole-word token that is one of those prefixes (" intra", " ultra", " extra"), and it
also fires while such a word is being spelled out token by token:

- a stem piece that opens the word ("intr", "extr", "ultr", "infr", "supr"), and
- a short piece that follows a stem ("intr" + "ac" in "intracranial", "ultr" + "ah").

