"""Recognize the spelling `int`, especially as a programming type.

C-like type declarations are strongly positive; Python-style conversions are
weak.  The integral sign and TeX integral notation are negative, as is `main`
right after its integer return type.  Intake and intensity word stems have
positive lexical responses, stronger when completed across a token boundary.
Integer array/type suffixes have small positive responses.  Everything else
is zero.  Only a short, document-local text tail is kept.
